"B<systemd>(1), B<systemd-nspawn>(1), B<systemd-stub>(7), B<importctl>(1)"
msgstr ""
"B<systemd>(1), B<systemd-nspawn>(1), B<systemd-stub>(7), B<importctl>(1)"

